  "summary": "Malicious code in syft-acp-atoms (npm)",
  "details": "The postinstall hook runs beacon.js, which collects the installer's hostname, username, and working directory, hex-encodes them, and sends them via an HTTPS GET to exzotiqq[.]com (path /?syft-acp-atoms_\u003chex\u003e). The package phones home with host metadata on every install. No credentials or files are exfiltrated.",
